OL,3,CA-Level results day 2026: Hundreds of
OL,4,Cthousands of students to receive grades
OL,6,FStudents across England, Wales and
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland will wake up to their
OL,8,Flong-awaited A-level results today.
OL,10,FHundreds of thousands of students are
OL,11,Freceiving grades to help them decide
OL,12,Fwhether to progress to university, an
OL,13,Fapprenticeship or work.
OL,15,FResults day comes amid a crisis in the
OL,16,Fnumber of young people not in
OL,17,Feducation, employment or training
OL,18,F(Neet).
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
