OL,3,CA-Level results day 2026: Hundreds of
OL,4,Cthousands of students to receive grades
OL,6,FThe Department for Education estimates
OL,7,Fthat nearly 58,000 18-year-olds in
OL,8,FEngland will get no results on
OL,9,FThursday because they have dropped out
OL,10,Fof education and training, although
OL,11,Fsome are working instead.
OL,13,FThe latest data, published in May,
OL,14,Fshowed the number of young people aged
OL,15,F16 to 24 neither working nor learning
OL,16,Fsurpassed one million for the first
OL,17,Ftime since 2013, reaching 1.01 million
OL,18,Fin the three months from January to
OL,19,FMarch.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
