OL,3,CA-Level results day 2026: Hundreds of
OL,4,Cthousands of students to receive grades
OL,6,FThe Education Secretary said she is
OL,7,Ffocused on a "revolution" in technical
OL,8,Fand vocational pathways to answer the
OL,9,F"clarion call" of the Neets crisis.
OL,11,FIn a statement ahead of results day,
OL,12,FLucy Powell said: "My priority is
OL,13,Fmaking sure every young person has the
OL,14,Fskills, knowledge, and confidence to
OL,15,Fthrive in the jobs of the future.
OL,26,@oD@NOUoD@YO]qD@AOUqD@NO]tD@SOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
