OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786637919
OL,3,CA-Level results day 2026: Hundreds of
OL,4,Cthousands of students to receive grades
OL,6,F"That's why we're giving technical
OL,7,Feducation the respect it deserves by
OL,8,Frolling out new V Levels to go
OL,9,Falongside A Levels, introducing
OL,10,Fbrilliant routes into the careers of
OL,11,Fthe future from age 14, and fully
OL,12,Ffunding apprenticeship training for
OL,13,Funder-25s."
OL,15,FFor many students, receiving their
OL,16,Fexam results on Thursday will also
OL,17,Fbring confirmation of university
OL,18,Fplaces.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@KO]
