OL,3,CA-Level results day 2026: Hundreds of
OL,4,Cthousands of students to receive grades
OL,6,FLast week, Jo Saxton, head of Ucas,
OL,7,Fsuggested a record number of 18-year-
OL,8,Folds could be successful in securing
OL,9,Ftheir first-choice university on
OL,10,Fresults day, with record highs also
OL,11,Fexpected to accept places through, and
OL,12,Fapply directly to, clearing.
OL,14,FInitial Ucas figures on Thursday show
OL,15,Fthe total number of 18 year olds in
OL,16,Fthe UK accepted on to degree courses
OL,17,Fhas risen by 3% on the same point last
OL,18,Fyear, with a record high of 262,820
OL,19,Ftaking up places so far.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
