OL,3,CA-Level results day 2026: Hundreds of
OL,4,Cthousands of students to receive grades
OL,6,FBut leaders in the sector warned that
OL,7,Fa "growing pressure" on student
OL,8,Ffinances and cost-of-living concerns
OL,9,Fwill be a prominent influence behind
OL,10,Fthe choices students make through
OL,11,Fclearing, amid a rise in students
OL,12,Fconsidering living at home and working
OL,13,Falongside their studies.
OL,15,FPowell said: "For those off to
OL,16,Funiversity, we're increasing
OL,17,Fmaintenance loans and reintroducing
OL,18,Fmaintenance grants to ensure no one is
OL,19,Fheld back by their background.
OL,26,@oD@COUoD@TO]wD@NOU
