OL,3,CA-Level results day 2026: Hundreds of
OL,4,Cthousands of students to receive grades
OL,6,F"Whether you're going into an
OL,7,Fapprenticeship or job, are off to one
OL,8,Fof our world-class universities, or
OL,9,Fare still working out your next steps,
OL,10,Fthere are brilliant options and
OL,11,Fexciting opportunities ahead."
OL,13,FOn the day before A-level results day,
OL,14,Fa Press Association sample of 131 of
OL,15,Fthe UK's largest higher education
OL,16,Fproviders showed there were 22,698
OL,17,Fcourses with vacancies for
OL,18,Fundergraduate students living in
OL,19,FEngland on the Ucas clearing site `
OL,20,Fwhich matches applicants to university
OL,21,Fplaces yet to be filled.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@^O]
