OL,3,CA-Level results day 2026: Hundreds of
OL,4,Cthousands of students to receive grades
OL,6,FThe figures showed 18 of the 24
OL,7,FRussell Group universities, which
OL,8,Frepresent some of the most selective
OL,9,FUK institutions, had vacancies on
OL,10,Fcourses for English residents ` a
OL,11,Ftotal of 3,483 courses between them.
OL,13,FClearing is available to students who
OL,14,Fdo not meet the conditions of their
OL,15,Foffer on A-level results day, as well
OL,16,Fas those who did not receive any
OL,17,Foffers.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
