OL,3,CA-Level results day 2026: Hundreds of
OL,4,Cthousands of students to receive grades
OL,6,FBut prospective students who have
OL,7,Fchanged their mind about what or where
OL,8,Fthey wish to study, and also those who
OL,9,Fhave applied outside the normal
OL,10,Fapplication window, can also use
OL,11,Fclearing.
OL,13,FHow were student's A-level results in
OL,14,Frecent years?
OL,16,FLast year, 28.3% of UK A-level entries
OL,17,Fwere awarded an A or A* grade ` the
OL,18,Fhighest proportion outside the
OL,19,Fpandemic-affected years of 2020-22.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/12
