OL,3,CA-Level results day 2026: Hundreds of
OL,4,Cthousands of students to receive grades
OL,6,FThe Covid-19 pandemic led to an
OL,7,Fincrease in top A-level grades in 2020
OL,8,Fand 2021, with results based on
OL,9,Fteacher assessments instead of exams.
OL,11,FIn 2019 ` the last year that summer
OL,12,Fexams were taken before the Covid-19
OL,13,Fpandemic ` 25.4% of UK A-level entries
OL,14,Fwere awarded top grades.
OL,16,FStudents who are receiving their A-
OL,17,Flevel and level 3 vocational and
OL,18,Ftechnical qualification results were
OL,19,Fin Year 7 when schools closed because
OL,20,Fof the pandemic.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/12
