OL,3,CA-Level results day 2026: Hundreds of
OL,4,Cthousands of students to receive grades
OL,6,FScotland has a different qualification
OL,7,Fsystem and students received their
OL,8,Fresults on Tuesday last week.
OL,10,FFigures showed the number of passes at
OL,11,FNational 5 reached record levels.
OL,13,FPass rates for National 5, Higher and
OL,14,FAdvanced Higher increased across the
OL,15,Fboard, to 79.2%, 76.7% and 77.6%
OL,16,Frespectively.
OL,18,FThe proportion of pupils who achieved
OL,19,Fan A also rose for National 5 and
OL,20,FHigher to 40.3% and 20.9%, while the
OL,21,Frate for Advanced Higher fell to 30.9%.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
